  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#user-interface\n\n> The \"play\" function in the user agent's interface must set the playbackRate attribute to the value of the defaultPlaybackRate attribute before invoking the play() method. \n\nHi, \nDoes that means the playback rate would be reset every time when pressing the \"play\" button, even if user have changed its playback rate?\n\nSTR.\n1. set playback rate = 2\n2. press play button in user interface\n3. press pause button in user interface\n4. press play button in user interface\n\nExpected. (What playback rate is correct?)\n5. playback rate = 1(default) OR playback rate = 2\n\nThanks!\n",
